---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-brand-dark">About</h1>

  <section class="mb-12 reveal">
    <p class="text-lg text-text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-4">
      I'm a Graduate Software Engineer based in Melbourne, with a Cybersecurity minor and a habit
      of actually finishing what I start &mdash; then going back and cutting the parts that weren't
      earning their keep. That's not a euphemism: I built an 11-container observability stack for
      a homelab, ran it, and then retired the whole thing once it was clear it wasn't worth the RAM.
      I wrote down why, instead of quietly deleting it.
    </p>
    <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      I'm currently building <a href="https://github.com/iamvanshkhanna/devpilot" class="text-brand-dark hover:underline">devpilot</a>,
      an AI code-review agent, alongside self-hosted infrastructure work and a couple of data/analytics
      projects. I like systems that are honest about their own trade-offs.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12 reveal">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-brand">Right now</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Education</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">B.E. Software Engineering (Honours) + Cybersecurity Minor &mdash; Deakin University</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Work rights</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Visa 485 &mdash; full work rights in Australia through October 2027</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Looking for</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Graduate Software Engineering or Application Security roles</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Based in</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Melbourne, Victoria, Australia</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reveal">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-brand">Skills</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Languages</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Python &middot; TypeScript &middot; C++</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Infrastructure</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Docker &middot; Linux &middot; Tailscale/Headscale mesh networking &middot; CI/CD</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Security</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Penetration testing fundamentals &middot; threat modelling (STRIDE)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-2xl p-5 bg-surface-light/20">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">AI/Data</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">LLM tooling &middot; local inference (Ollama) &middot; pandas data pipelines</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
